WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
I really want to live.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.400
And if you're watching this video,
I have every chance of surviving.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.200
Over the years of teaching, you meet
a great many different students.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:20.000
But every teacher has that one student
you simply cannot overlook.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.800
The one who is always engaged in the lesson —
even on no sleep, even in a bad mood.

6
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.000
He always raises his hand, asks questions,
takes part in every discussion.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.600
For me, that student was always
Egor Barakhtenko.

8
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.000
Very bright, active, incredibly kind
and positive.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.900
But today Egor isn't fighting for grades.
Today he is fighting for his life.

10
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:48.700
Hi everyone, I'm Egor Barakhtenko.
I have acute myeloblastic leukaemia.

11
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.000
I've been in treatment for almost two years.

12
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.400
And this is my sister.

13
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.900
Egor loves playing the guitar —
he plays it all the time.

14
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.900
You can hear it all over the house.

15
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.900
He got top marks in almost every exam,
except physics, unfortunately.

16
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.900
And he finished ninth grade
with honours.

17
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.900
We talk to each other constantly,
we're very close.

18
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.900
Hello. My name is Maria,
I am Egor Barakhtenko's mother.

19
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.200
For two years now, Egorushka
has been fighting for his life.

20
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.100
These two years have brought
so many trials.

21
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.800
But he is still just as cheerful,
undaunted and positive.

22
00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.600
He believes in people, in kindness, in love.

23
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:36.900
Now the doctors at the Boren clinic
are giving him a chance to recover.

24
00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.900
And we are so grateful.

25
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:44.900
If you can offer help and support
with the fundraiser —

26
00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:45.900
thank you so very much.

27
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:53.500
If you're watching this video,
then I have a chance of recovery.

28
00:01:53.500 --> 00:02:03.100
One person cannot change the world,
but one person can change another's life.

29
00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:07.500
Thank you all so much
for watching this video.

30
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.800
I want this fundraiser to keep going,
because it matters so much to me.

31
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.200
Thank you.

32
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:29.700
♪ Egor plays and sings ♪
